## Vendored: coder/claudecode.nvim

`lua/codriver/vendor/claudecode/` is a vendored copy of
https://github.com/coder/claudecode.nvim, MIT licensed,
Copyright (c) 2025 Coder Technologies Inc.

The full upstream licence text is retained verbatim at
`lua/codriver/vendor/LICENSE.claudecode`.

The vendored files are upstream-identical except for one mechanical transform:
every Lua module path naming `claudecode` is re-rooted under
`codriver.vendor.`, so this plugin can coexist on Neovim's runtimepath with a
separate claudecode.nvim install. That transform is applied by
`scripts/vendor-sync.sh` and is reproducible from the pinned upstream commit
recorded in `VENDOR.md`. No other modifications are made.
